 #edb/ref 17592186358831 13194139535638 true] [17592186358768 1017 #edb/ref 17592186358769 13194139535638 true] [17592186358768 1089 "q-140367" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358768 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535638 true] [17592186358768 1100 "Consider the vector $x$ and the subspace $S=\\text{Span}{{a}_{1},{a}_{2}},$ where\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFind the distance between $x$ and the subspace $S$ given that the set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2}}$ is orthogonal." 13194139535638 true] [17592186358768 1113 #uuid "835e6f56-4b55-54bc-8dba-c3d154485354" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358768 1145 "Since the set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2}}$ is orthogonal, the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the subspace $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x={\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{1}}x+{\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{2}}x.\n$$\n\nSo, we first find the orthogonal projections of $x$ onto $\\text{Span}{{a}_{1}}$ and $\\text{Span}{{a}_{2}}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{1}}x & =\\frac{x\\cdot {a}_{1}}{{a}_{1}\\cdot {a}_{1}}{a}_{1}=\\frac{6\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot 0+(-4)\\cdot 2}{{2}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{2}^{2}}{a}_{1}=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{2}}x & =\\frac{x\\cdot {a}_{2}}{{a}_{2}\\cdot {a}_{2}}{a}_{2}=\\frac{6\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot 1+(-4)\\cdot (-1)}{{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}{a}_{2}=3[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & ={\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{1}}x+{\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{2}}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+3[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]=\\overset{^}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the distance between $x$ and the subspace $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d(x,\\overset{^}{x}) & =‖x-\\overset{^}{x}‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{({x}_{1}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{1})^{2}+({x}_{2}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{2})^{2}+({x}_{3}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(6-4)}^{2}+{(-1-3)}^{2}+{(-4-(-2))}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+16+4} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358769 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358770 13194139535638 true] [17592186358769 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358771 13194139535638 true] [17592186358769 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358772 13194139535638 true] [17592186358769 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358773 13194139535638 true] [17592186358769 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358774 13194139535638 true] [17592186358769 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535638 true] [17592186358769 1041 "selection" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358769 1104 #edb/ref 17592186358774 13194139535638 true] [17592186358769 1110 #uuid "d52d91bf-103b-5e2c-b620-5b7047927f8d" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358770 1034 "2\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358770 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535638 true] [17592186358770 1111 #uuid "22c1d0d4-da84-52bf-b93e-0c13066a06df" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358771 1034 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358771 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535638 true] [17592186358771 1111 #uuid "cdb6c99c-76a4-5925-9618-c8976a394310" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358772 1034 "\\sqrt{6}" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358772 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535638 true] [17592186358772 1111 #uuid "6cdc04cf-3499-5f62-99f7-1da7b8ed286f" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358773 1034 "3\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358773 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535638 true] [17592186358773 1111 #uuid "72912aa4-533e-502d-9af4-6deae7cce76f" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358774 1034 "2\\sqrt{6}" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358774 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535638 true] [17592186358774 1111 #uuid "41dc1eec-6d8a-5357-8005-13576ffef99a" 13194139535638 true] [17592186358775 1017 #edb/ref 17592186358776 13194139535638 